A bug in PC Nethack 3.09:

While standing at an altar, I ate the contents of a tin.  The tin contained
deep fried something or other. My hands became slippery, so my weapon and rings
fell to the altar.  As I picked them up, they had NOT been identified as
blessed, uncursed or cursed.  To find out, I had to DROP them.  I think this is
a bug (clearly, a very minor one).  I don't know if this is present in the
non-PC versions.

Something I would like to see in future versions:
At the end of a game, when I am asked if I wish my belongings to be identified,
I would like to see the attribute 'rustproofed' for the weapons and armor it
applies.

